Subject: [PATCH 3/4] thumbnail: Fix blanking in isEncryptedPackage

The camera helper isEncryptedPackage hardcodes the package name
com.coloros.gallery3d and checks it through
com.oplus.app.OPlusAccessControlManager. On AOSP that call resolves
to the oplus-fwk stub, whose isEncryptedPackage() returns true for
every package, so gallery media is treated as private and the camera
clears the last-shot thumbnail. After opening the gallery and coming
back, the thumbnail is a flat grey placeholder until the next
capture.

Short-circuit the helper so it returns false: replace the method body
with a constant false return, using ".locals 1" because the body
writes v0.

---
 smali/d6/l0.smali | 46 +++++++++++++++---------------------------------
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)
---
 smali/d6/l0.smali | 46 +++-------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 43 deletions(-)

